      "id": "c1",
      "title": "第一章 · 蓝底白花",
      "subtitle": "序之后全部过场（cinematic + 微过场），不含玩法活卡本身",
      "shots": [
        {"id":"01","file":"Texture_C1Open01_ColdStove.jpg","beat":"c1_open","dur":"4.0s","cam":"insert","picture":"灶是冷的。柱子蹲在灶前，摸了一把锅底——干的。","line":""},
        {"id":"02","file":"Texture_C1Open02_GrainUrn.jpg","beat":"c1_open","dur":"3.8s","cam":"insert","picture":"他掀开粮瓮。瓮底只剩薄薄一层糜子。","line":""},
        {"id":"03","file":"Texture_C1Open07_WaterVat.jpg","beat":"c1_open","dur":"5.6s","cam":"insert","picture":"水缸见了底。瓢探下去刮着缸底，提上来小半瓢。","line":""},
        {"id":"04","file":"Texture_C1Open03_CollapsedShed.jpg","beat":"c1_open","dur":"5.6s","cam":"shot","picture":"牲口棚塌了半边。橛子还在，缰绳没有断口——是解走的。","line":""},
        {"id":"05","file":"Texture_C1Open04_EmptyCoop.jpg","beat":"c1_open","dur":"3.0s","cam":"insert","picture":"鸡笼倒在墙边。里面是空的。","line":""},
        {"id":"06","file":"Texture_C1Open08_TuckQuilt.jpg","beat":"c1_open","dur":"2.8s","cam":"shot","picture":"妹妹蜷在炕上。柱子替她把露在外头的脚盖好。","line":""},
        {"id":"07","file":"Texture_C1Open05_ShortSleeve.jpg","beat":"c1_open","dur":"3.8s","cam":"insert","picture":"去年的褂子短了一截，袖口遮不住手腕。","line":""},
        {"id":"08","file":"Texture_C1Open06_ThirdDay.jpg","beat":"c1_open","dur":"3.2s","cam":"insert","picture":"第三天。还是没人来叫。","line":"旁白：「第三天。还是没人来叫。」"},

        {"id":"09","file":"Texture_C1Forage01_UntieSeed.jpg","beat":"c1_forage","dur":"3.2s","cam":"insert","picture":"推开焦木。解开袋口。袋里全是谷种。","line":""},
        {"id":"10","file":"Texture_C1Forage02_LeaveSeed.jpg","beat":"c1_forage","dur":"3.0s","cam":"insert","picture":"柱子捻起几粒谷种。娘的声音自己找上来。","line":"娘的声音：「留种。谁也不能动。」"},
        {"id":"11","file":"Texture_C1Forage03_RetieSack.jpg","beat":"c1_forage","dur":"3.0+2.8s","cam":"insert → shot","picture":"袋口拧紧，绕绳，压回砖下。苇席重新盖上。","line":""},
        {"id":"12","file":"Texture_C1Forage04_BlueRag.jpg","beat":"c1_forage","dur":"3.2s","cam":"insert","picture":"碗片下面垫着一圈蓝底白花碎布。","line":""},
        {"id":"13","file":"Texture_C1Forage05_FlashbackArm.jpg","beat":"c1_forage","dur":"1.3s","cam":"insert 仰看窖口","picture":"硬切闪回：娘跪在窖口的手臂，同序那一镜机位。","line":""},
        {"id":"14","file":"Texture_C1Forage06_DriedYam.jpg","beat":"c1_forage","dur":"4.2s","cam":"insert","picture":"坛里十来片红薯干。他数了一遍。又数了一遍。","line":""},

        {"id":"15","file":"Texture_C1Meal01_SoakYam.jpg","beat":"c1_meal","dur":"4.0s","cam":"insert","picture":"两片红薯干泡进碗里。温水。软了点。","line":""},
        {"id":"16","file":"Texture_C1Meal02_SisterWakes.jpg","beat":"c1_meal","dur":"1.8+2.2s","cam":"shot → insert","picture":"她坐在炕上，头发还贴着脸。","line":"妹妹：「哥？」「你上哪了？」"},
        {"id":"17","file":"Texture_C1Meal03_PushLonger.jpg","beat":"c1_meal","dur":"3.0s","cam":"insert","picture":"不管长的在谁碗里，她都把长的那截推到他面前。","line":""},
        {"id":"18","file":"Texture_C1Meal04_EatYours.jpg","beat":"c1_meal","dur":"2.6s","cam":"shot","picture":"他捞出来，沥两滴，搁回她碗里。","line":"柱子：「吃你的。」"},

        {"id":"19","file":"Texture_C1Tally01_AskDraw.jpg","beat":"c1_tally","dur":"4.4+2.4s","cam":"shot → insert","picture":"她走到门框边，仰头看那两道线。","line":"妹妹：「今天还画吗？」"},
        {"id":"20","file":"Texture_C1Tally02_ReachChalk.jpg","beat":"c1_tally","dur":"3.2s","cam":"shot","picture":"踮脚去够窗台上的石笔。够不到。","line":"柱子：「画。」"},
        {"id":"21","file":"Texture_C1Tally03_LiftToWall.jpg","beat":"c1_tally","dur":"3.4+4.4s","cam":"shot","picture":"抱起来，一只手托住她，石笔塞进她手里。","line":""},

        {"id":"22","file":"Texture_C1Count01_ThreeMarks.jpg","beat":"c1_count","dur":"3.0+4.1s","cam":"insert","picture":"吹掉石粉。一道一道点。","line":"妹妹：「一。」「二。」「三。」"},
        {"id":"23","file":"Texture_C1Count02_WhenReturn.jpg","beat":"c1_count","dur":"2.8+2.4s","cam":"insert → close","picture":"她回头看柱子。柱子没有回答。","line":"妹妹：「他们啥时候回来？」"},
        {"id":"24","file":"Texture_C1Count03_LadleKnock.jpg","beat":"c1_count","dur":"3.2s","cam":"insert","picture":"水缸边的瓢轻轻滑了一下，磕在缸底。","line":""},

        {"id":"25","file":"Texture_C1Say101_SoonDown.jpg","beat":"c1_say1","dur":"2.2+2.4s","cam":"close → shot","picture":"玩家一按。把她放到地上。","line":"柱子：「快了。」"},
        {"id":"26","file":"Texture_C1Say102_FetchWater.jpg","beat":"c1_say1","dur":"4.0+2.2+2.0s","cam":"shot","picture":"瓢再次碰到缸底。他看向妹妹。","line":"柱子：「俺去打水。」「你跟紧。」"},

        {"id":"27","file":"Texture_C1Walk01_BaldElms.jpg","beat":"c1_walk","dur":"4.2+2.2s","cam":"shot","picture":"路边两棵榆树，皮刮掉只剩发白树干。她没有停。","line":""},
        {"id":"28","file":"Texture_C1Walk02_DigHerb.jpg","beat":"c1_walk","dur":"3.2+3.0+2.2s","cam":"shot → insert","picture":"田埂边忽然蹲下，用小棍刨出土，挖出一棵苦菜。","line":"妹妹：「哥，大的。」"},
        {"id":"29","file":"Texture_C1Walk03_PocketHerb.jpg","beat":"c1_walk","dur":"1.8+3.2s","cam":"shot","picture":"苦菜进了桶边挂着的小布兜。","line":"柱子：「搁兜里。」"},

        {"id":"30","file":"Texture_C1Well01_FullBucket.jpg","beat":"c1_well","dur":"3.8+2.0s","cam":"insert → shot","picture":"满桶提到地面。掂一下。沉。","line":"柱子：「走了。」"},

        {"id":"31","file":"Texture_C1Return01_BikeBell.jpg","beat":"c1_return","dur":"2.4+2.8s","cam":"shot","picture":"妹妹忽然站住。远处链条声，一下车铃。","line":""},
        {"id":"32","file":"Texture_C1Return02_SetBucket.jpg","beat":"c1_return","dur":"2.8s","cam":"insert","picture":"走进阴影，水桶自动轻轻放下。水面仍在晃。","line":""},

        {"id":"33","file":"Texture_C1Bell01_HoldAndBikes.jpg","beat":"c1_bell","dur":"13s 长按","cam":"shot 固定","picture":"按住妹妹。两辆自行车真进画面：村口捏闸支腿，朝塌房张望。","line":""},
        {"id":"34","file":"Texture_C1Bell02_WhoThere.jpg","beat":"c1_bell","dur":"失败回卷","cam":"shot → dark","picture":"全章唯一失败：走出阴影或松手。画面收黑，回到车铃响起时。","line":"伪军：「谁在那儿？」"},

        {"id":"35","file":"Texture_C1Uncle01_AfterBell.jpg","beat":"c1_uncle","dur":"3.4+5.4s","cam":"shot","picture":"链条声远去。水还在。七叔扶墙站起来——他也蹲着的。","line":""},
        {"id":"36","file":"Texture_C1Uncle02_BlackBeans.jpg","beat":"c1_uncle","dur":"4.8+3.2s","cam":"shot → insert","picture":"七叔往他怀里塞一把黑豆。柱子往回推，七叔按住他的手。","line":"七叔：「晚上过来吃。」"},
        {"id":"37","file":"Texture_C1Uncle03_ISaidSo.jpg","beat":"c1_uncle","dur":"2.2+1.4+2.2s","cam":"insert","picture":"再次按住他的手，把那笔债说成是真的。","line":"七叔：「我说有。」「就有。」"},

        {"id":"38","file":"Texture_C1Pour01_VatLine.jpg","beat":"c1_pour","dur":"3.8+2.8s","cam":"insert","picture":"提起桶底。水冲进缸里，留下浅浅一层水线。","line":""},
        {"id":"39","file":"Texture_C1Pour02_ScoopPot.jpg","beat":"c1_pour","dur":"2.8s","cam":"shot","picture":"舀一瓢水倒进锅里。","line":""},

        {"id":"40","file":"Texture_C1Cook01_Ingredients.jpg","beat":"c1_cook","dur":"3.0+3.2+4.0+2.6s","cam":"insert → shot","picture":"最后一把糜子、掰碎的红薯干、她递来的苦菜、七叔那把黑豆。","line":""},
        {"id":"41","file":"Texture_C1Cook02_LightStove.jpg","beat":"c1_cook","dur":"4.4+3.8s","cam":"insert","picture":"谷秸塞进灶膛。火镰点着草绒。蹲下吹气。","line":""},
        {"id":"42","file":"Texture_C1Cook03_SteamDusk.jpg","beat":"c1_cook","dur":"4.6+3.2s","cam":"shot → insert","picture":"天色从灰白变成暗黄。锅盖边冒出第一缕热气。","line":""},
        {"id":"43","file":"Texture_C1Cook04_BowlsEmpty.jpg","beat":"c1_cook","dur":"4.0+3.2s","cam":"shot → insert","picture":"两碗见底。锅底露出来。她坐在炕边打盹。","line":""},

        {"id":"44","file":"Texture_C1Share01_PushBowls.jpg","beat":"c1_share","dur":"2.8+2.6s","cam":"insert","picture":"被撞见：她按住两只碗，把他的碗推回来。","line":"妹妹：「哥，你也吃。」"},
        {"id":"45","file":"Texture_C1Share02_RinseWater.jpg","beat":"c1_share","dur":"2.0+2.2s","cam":"shot","picture":"舀一点水晃匀，递过去。","line":"柱子：「涮锅水。」「别糟践了。」"},
        {"id":"46","file":"Texture_C1Share03_RagOnWrist.jpg","beat":"c1_share","dur":"3.4+3.0s","cam":"insert 同开场手腕","picture":"坛口碎布贴到露出的手腕旁。只够盖住一小块。","line":"妹妹：「哥……」「冷。」"},
        {"id":"47","file":"Texture_C1Share04_LookCellar.jpg","beat":"c1_share","dur":"3.0s","cam":"shot","picture":"看向院中的菜窖。下窖的理由改成找布。","line":"目标：找块布，把她的袖口接长。"},

        {"id":"48","file":"Texture_C1Cellar01_MoonHatch.jpg","beat":"c1_cellar","dur":"3.6s","cam":"insert 同序机位","picture":"月光落进窖口。板缝里的光，与三天前一样。","line":""},
        {"id":"49","file":"Texture_C1Cellar02_OldJacket.jpg","beat":"c1_cellar","dur":"4.2+3.0+3.2s","cam":"insert → shot","picture":"旧褂袖口磨飞了边。针别在衣领上。放到梯子旁。","line":""},
        {"id":"50","file":"Texture_C1Cellar03_PatternMatch.jpg","beat":"c1_cellar","dur":"3.8+3.4+3.4s","cam":"insertCard wholeCloth","picture":"整块蓝底白花，没下过剪子。碎布放上去，花纹接在一起。","line":""},
        {"id":"51","file":"Texture_C1Cellar04_FaceCloth.jpg","beat":"c1_cellar","dur":"3.8s","cam":"insert","picture":"抱起整布，把脸贴上去。只贴了一下。","line":""},
        {"id":"52","file":"Texture_C1Cellar05_GrabWrist.jpg","beat":"c1_cellar","dur":"3.0+3.0s","cam":"insert","picture":"一只手从黑暗里抓住手腕。整块蓝布留在草苫旁。","line":"陌生人：「水。」"},

